Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 01:30:27 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Charter Phase 13: DIFFERENCE RELAY, game five

Second game authored on the v3 contract through NEW_GAME.md, under the
requirement 7.4 zero engine changes rule. Zero engine changes wanted.

Imperfect information relay: six numbers over six stations under five adjacency
difference constraints, some visible and some hidden. The baton runs left to
right and stops at the first failing gap, so feedback is a position, not a count.
Win or loss over six runs, scored against a forced deduction par. Uniqueness is a
full 6! enumeration, EXACT. Fairness is a no guess minimax deduction reaching the
unique order within the budget, strictly stronger than uniqueness. Difficulty is
forced deduction work, banded over seven septiles. Reversal symmetry is broken by
a screen. The independent verifier agrees with the generator over 365 days.

Design document DIFFERENCE-RELAY.md answers all 28 section 44 items. Green: 977
tests in 75 files, all five verifiers, build, budget, certify --check unchanged.
DIFFERENCE RELAY stays planned until its manual mobile and offline smoke checks.

